01:41:55.110 --> 01:41:56.330
Everything is fine.

01:41:56.530 --> 01:41:57.630
What are you so worried about?

01:41:57.770 --> 01:41:58.830
They'll be all right.

01:41:59.070 --> 01:41:59.810
They're my kids.

01:42:00.000 --> 01:42:03.170
Don't worry. Easy for you to say.

01:42:39.980 --> 01:42:48.790
so beautiful. What's so great about that? I've been on space shuttle so much I've forgotten how

