01:43:09.860 --> 01:43:10.280
It's not...

01:43:13.610 --> 01:43:15.160
Got to keep the regulations.

01:43:15.420 --> 01:43:16.720
Remember what the teacher said.

01:43:16.920 --> 01:43:18.340
Everybody has to cooperate.

01:43:18.760 --> 01:43:19.000
Yes.

01:43:19.140 --> 01:43:21.540
A small thing may turn into a big problem.

01:43:22.510 --> 01:43:22.810
What?

01:43:22.930 --> 01:43:24.890
