I see. So it wasn't your concern for the children that made you want to go with them.

01:47:14.310 --> 01:47:19.230
Of course. There's nothing that concerns me more. I wonder where they are.

01:47:19.370 --> 01:47:22.790
Then you'll be pleased to know that the rocket will be reaching the moon shortly.

01:47:25.340 --> 01:47:29.940
The rainbow comet is just about to come into orbit with Venus. It must be a beauty.

01:47:30.000 --> 01:47:30.580
sight.

01:49:11.840 --> 01:49:15.960
Dr. Elephant, the rocket carrying the Astronomy Club's students, is veering off course!

01:49:16.220 --> 01:49:16.520
What?

01:50:01.020 --> 01:50:01.260
Thank you.

01:50:41.960 --> 01:50:43.520
Long time, eh, Astro?

01:50:43.780 --> 01:50:45.280
Eh, then this must be...

01:50:45.280 --> 01:50:45.980
That's right.

01:50:46.160 --> 01:50:49.140
The crystal castle of the future conqueror of the Earth.

01:50:49.460 --> 01:50:50.240
Welcome back.

01:50:51.740 --> 01:50:54.770
Are you still planning that, everybody?

01:50:54.990 --> 01:50:55.650
What have you done...

01:50:57.500 --> 01:50:59.480
Ha, ha, ha, I won't kill them.

01:51:00.030 --> 01:51:02.050
Astro, are you going to listen to me now?

01:51:02.210 --> 01:51:04.900
I told you I will join your evil class.

01:51:05.300 --> 01:51:09.200
Not evil, just sacrifices that lead to good.

01:51:09.460 --> 01:51:12.470
I want to have human friends. I like them.

01:51:12.910 --> 01:51:15.830
You're a fool. What do you gain by having human friends?

01:51:19.380 --> 01:51:21.780
Astro, let me show you what I can offer you.

01:51:23.240 --> 01:51:23.380
Huh?

01:51:29.730 --> 01:51:29.890
What?

01:51:30.000 --> 01:51:32.700
Oh, what a big hat. I wonder whose it is.

01:51:32.980 --> 01:51:36.240
But I think I've seen it before.

01:51:37.280 --> 01:51:38.900
No, wait a minute.

01:51:39.360 --> 01:51:40.840
This is just like mine.

01:51:41.480 --> 01:51:43.000
How did it get to be so big?

01:51:43.780 --> 01:51:44.260
Astro!

01:51:46.190 --> 01:51:47.990
I'm over here. Here I am.

01:51:48.300 --> 01:51:48.960
Over there.

01:51:55.470 --> 01:51:56.450
I thought I heard him.

01:51:56.730 --> 01:51:57.590
Hey, Alvin!

01:52:00.730 --> 01:52:01.970
What's happening?

01:52:13.890 --> 01:52:15.970
Hey, how did you all get to be so big?

01:52:16.560 --> 01:52:18.320
We're not big. You just got...

01:52:19.460 --> 01:52:20.660
Yeah, why you?

01:52:22.560 --> 01:52:25.240
Better watch out or I'll flatten you.

01:52:25.800 --> 01:52:27.640
They're starting to realize what's happening.

01:52:27.900 --> 01:52:29.320
Now I'll show them a little more.

01:52:48.840 --> 01:52:52.680
If you don't join me, I'll shrink your friends just like that, one at a time.

01:52:52.960 --> 01:52:55.760
But if you do join me, I'll send them back safely to Earth.

01:52:55.960 --> 01:52:57.980
Now it's all up to you, Astro.

01:53:00.920 --> 01:53:01.940
Yeah, I'm blackless.

01:53:02.520 --> 01:53:03.760
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

01:53:03.940 --> 01:53:05.660
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

01:53:09.840 --> 01:53:11.660
Astro! Astro! Astro!

01:53:11.980 --> 01:53:15.790
Hmm, no reply at all.

01:53:16.030 --> 01:53:17.370
What's happened up there?

01:53:18.330 --> 01:53:19.330
Okay, tough guy.

01:53:19.530 --> 01:53:20.990
Now that you've been cut down to size,

01:53:21.110 --> 01:53:22.170
you know what's gonna happen to you.

01:53:22.290 --> 01:53:22.730
I didn't...

01:53:31.210 --> 01:53:41.480
Keep them all small.

01:53:41.660 --> 01:53:44.060
I don't like this idea of having to run for my little girl.

01:53:45.500 --> 01:53:47.480
I can shrink them even more.

01:53:48.910 --> 01:53:51.890
One more hour, Astro.

01:53:51.990 --> 01:53:52.970
He'll disappear altogether.

01:54:02.110 --> 01:54:29.640
Do it, just let my friends go and make s***

01:54:40.460 --> 01:54:41.780
Fasten your seatbelts.

01:54:41.820 --> 01:54:43.140
But Astro isn't here.

01:54:43.320 --> 01:54:44.040
Neither is Jump.

01:54:53.250 --> 01:54:55.930
It's the moon, but it sure looks funny, doesn't it?

01:54:57.280 --> 01:54:58.360
Hey, what's that?

01:55:01.400 --> 01:55:12.050
the rocket are they all right this is strange they're still in danger i calculated their course

01:55:12.050 --> 01:55:21.680
the rocket is nearing what can't be right the surface of venus is over 400 degrees a fiery hell

01:55:21.680 --> 01:55:22.640
they'll never survive

01:55:37.640 --> 01:55:40.060
Astro, at last, you're my comrade.

01:55:40.440 --> 01:55:40.880
Astro!

01:55:41.450 --> 01:55:41.730
Huh?

01:55:43.440 --> 01:55:46.120
Astro, Astro, come in!

01:55:47.520 --> 01:55:48.040
Oh, John!

01:55:48.860 --> 01:55:49.300
Astro!

01:55:51.670 --> 01:55:52.110
Durr!

01:55:52.170 --> 01:55:54.950
Ah, Astro, the rocket's heading for Venus.

01:55:55.170 --> 01:55:55.810
Do something!

01:55:56.450 --> 01:55:57.810
Venus, it can't be!

01:55:58.290 --> 01:55:59.870
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

01:56:00.030 --> 01:56:01.850
Why so surprised?

01:56:02.250 --> 01:56:07.330
I have it in my power to send a rocket to any place in the galaxy I choose.

01:56:07.650 --> 01:56:10.770
So you plan to send them to Venus all along?

01:56:11.400 --> 01:56:15.500
I thought it would be educational for them to view the rainbow comet from there.

01:56:18.050 --> 01:56:19.670
I've got to save them!

01:56:22.120 --> 01:56:23.500
Stop him! Seize him!

01:57:14.490 --> 01:57:17.240
Get away from me

01:57:44.490 --> 01:57:45.430
I think this is what you wanted.

01:58:17.720 --> 01:58:18.040
What are you-

01:59:30.220 --> 01:59:52.520
Oh, no, get the lightning saber.

02:00:07.710 --> 02:00:08.790
Oh, Astro's gone.

02:01:02.240 --> 02:01:04.600
Why do you resist me like this?

02:01:05.040 --> 02:01:10.370
Alright, if you continue to go against my will, we are enemies from this day forward.

02:01:30.510 --> 02:01:43.360
The new subway trains were wonderful and a lot of fun to ride.

02:01:43.600 --> 02:01:45.800
They could go over a hundred miles an hour,

02:01:45.940 --> 02:01:48.870
but nobody ever thought one of them would go out of control.

02:01:49.210 --> 02:01:51.670
It reached dangerous speed, and nobody knew why.

02:01:52.880 --> 02:01:56.640
It was Atlas again, tricking me into coming out to face him.

02:01:59.520 --> 02:01:59.960
See how it...

02:02:00.030 --> 02:02:04.670
It turns out, tune in next time for the Runaway Subway here on Astro Boy.

02:03:31.530 --> 02:03:35.270
The new subway trains were wonderful and a lot of fun to ride.

02:03:35.570 --> 02:03:37.710
They could go over 100 miles an hour,

02:03:37.870 --> 02:03:40.770
but nobody ever thought one of them would go out of control.

02:03:41.130 --> 02:03:43.590
It reached dangerous speed, and nobody knew why.

02:03:44.790 --> 02:03:48.530
It was Atlas again, tricking me into coming out to face him.

02:03:51.440 --> 02:03:52.540
See how it turns out.

02:03:52.850 --> 02:03:56.550
Tune in next time for the Runaway Subway here on Astro Boy.

02:04:02.620 --> 02:04:06.860
The Golden Coral Forest was the most beautiful place I'd ever seen.

02:04:07.470 --> 02:04:11.050
A great sea current threatened to wipe out all the young fish living there,

02:04:11.210 --> 02:04:13.710
so with my new friends, I tried to save them.

02:04:14.080 --> 02:04:16.740
Then came trouble from a greedy gold hunter

02:04:16.740 --> 02:04:19.780
who thought the coral forest was his own personal gold mine,

02:04:19.840 --> 02:04:22.860
and then more trouble from a monster we hadn't counted on.

02:04:23.740 --> 02:04:26.420
Tune in next time for The Monster of Clarkin'.

02:04:32.620 --> 02:04:37.880
After a large meteorite fell to Earth, I went with Dr. Elephant and a team of scientists to investigate.

02:04:38.120 --> 02:04:39.700
But it was no meteorite.

02:04:39.800 --> 02:04:43.920
It was a huge robot being delivered through space from one planet to another.

02:04:44.220 --> 02:04:45.780
Its name was Galan.

02:04:46.060 --> 02:04:49.560
It had power so great it could transform entire planets.

02:04:49.980 --> 02:04:52.720
Once activated, it couldn't be stopped by force.

02:04:53.120 --> 02:04:56.960
Tune in next time for the Genie from Outer Space here on Astro Boy.

02:05:04.700 --> 02:05:13.230
What happens when three robots, a fireman, a nurse, and a welder, find themselves out of work and unwanted?

02:05:13.770 --> 02:05:15.850
Usually it means the scrap factory.

02:05:16.260 --> 02:05:20.380
But in this case, with a little encouragement from me, they don't give up.

02:05:20.520 --> 02:05:25.940
And when trouble calls and no one's there to help, my friends all do their parts to save the day.

02:05:26.480 --> 02:05:29.900
Tune in next time and meet the robots nobody wanted.

02:05:30.000 --> 02:05:31.180
on Astro Ball.

02:05:35.390 --> 02:05:37.730
My family and I went on a skiing trip,

02:05:37.750 --> 02:05:39.650
but it was interrupted

02:05:39.650 --> 02:05:41.470
when some strange spaceships

02:05:41.470 --> 02:05:42.790
appeared from another planet.

02:05:43.090 --> 02:05:44.920
I met a girl named Violet

02:05:44.920 --> 02:05:46.240
from the Alsor system.

02:05:46.480 --> 02:05:48.140
She warned me that the ships had come

02:05:48.140 --> 02:05:49.560
to get water from the Earth.

02:05:50.090 --> 02:05:51.770
The robots had malfunctioned,

02:05:51.810 --> 02:05:53.790
and instead of asking for the water,

02:05:53.970 --> 02:05:55.810
they were going to take it by force.

02:05:56.090 --> 02:05:57.950
Be sure to tune in next time

02:05:57.950 --> 02:05:59.770
for The Girl from Alsor.

02:06:06.360 --> 02:06:08.220
Robotland is a fantasy park.

02:06:08.420 --> 02:06:11.380
It's a place every kid dreams of visiting.

02:06:12.180 --> 02:06:15.480
One day, a robot swan flew away from the park

02:06:15.480 --> 02:06:17.600
and came right to my house.

02:06:18.020 --> 02:06:20.420
The Devil King came after the swan,

02:06:20.520 --> 02:06:23.020
who turned out to be a beautiful girl in disguise.

02:06:23.940 --> 02:06:27.080
Robotland is beautiful, but when I went to rescue the girl,

02:06:27.260 --> 02:06:29.900
I found out it was also full of danger.

02:06:30.000 --> 02:06:32.420
Tune in next time for Robot Land.
